Changes made in this fork (version 2.0.0) include, among others:

- new application id and package: ru.archeonzero.azchat;
- new application name "AZ chat" and a new launcher icon set;
- reworked logic for attachment/preview overlays (auto-opened panels are
  hidden; previews opened by the user stay; hidden nodes are restored on
  the next intentional tap);
- saving of blob: downloads through a JavaScript bridge into the system
  Download folder;
- scroll-aware pull-to-refresh and a JS scroll bridge;
- a portable build script (JAVA_HOME from environment, SDK path from
  local.properties, APK copied to dist/);
- version 2.0.0 (versionCode 20).

